      ],
      "description": "The pink paper remains the single most-monitored title among the comms professionals Inkline is built for, and for a reason that has little to do with circulation: an FT story is what moves an IR phone line before the market opens. Lex and Alphaville carry disproportionate weight relative to their length, and Due Diligence frequently breaks M&A detail hours ahead of the wires. Feed access has quietly narrowed over the past few years, with several desk feeds no longer publicly listed, which is precisely the kind of gap hand-verification exists to close. If a client is listed in London, this is the first monitor to set up."
    },
    {
