      ],
      "description": "Wire copy is upstream of everything else a monitor reads, which makes this agency's retreat from public syndication one of the more consequential quiet changes in the industry: the feeds most aggregators still list stopped updating when the website moved behind registration. Inkline resolves the desks through verified alternatives and says so plainly on the record for each. Speed remains the reason to monitor a wire at all, as corporate statements routinely appear here before the papers that will later analyse them. A headline here is a starting gun. The full story follows elsewhere, usually within the hour."
    },
