      "description": "Free at Tube stations and free online, which gives Square Mile stories a reach into general readership that its circulation figures understate. The desk moves fast on IPO and listings news and is often the first written coverage a mid-cap announcement receives. Since the ecommerce group's acquisition the opinion pages have grown livelier, and comms teams underrate them at their peril, because a sharp column here gets screenshotted into the City's group chats by mid-morning."
