      "description": "Journalists read this to find out what is happening to journalism, which makes it the closest thing the industry has to a staffing wire: editor moves, desk closures and title sales appear here first, and each one changes who a comms team should be pitching. The audience-data series has become a reference in its own right, tracking which publishers are actually growing rather than which claim to be. For anyone maintaining a media list by hand, this title is the maintenance schedule."
