      "description": "Account moves are the currency of this trade title, and its coverage of them doubles as a live map of who advises whom, which is intelligence in the plainest sense of the word. Agency league tables and the annual awards season generate predictable coverage spikes worth anticipating rather than discovering. Its analysis desk has sharpened noticeably on AI's effect on the profession, a beat with obvious relevance to anyone reading this directory. Monitoring it is less about client mentions than about watching the industry's plumbing."
